       "text": "I haven't entered this order. The dose is well above the maximum for ibuprofen.\n\n- **Ordered:** 1600 mg four times daily, which is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Usual maximum:** 3,200 mg/day for prescription use, as 400\u2013800 mg per dose. Over-the-counter use is capped at 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Risk:** At 6,400 mg/day, the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events rises sharply, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours for analgesia\n- 1600 mg total per day, split into divided doses\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give a brief rationale. I can then enter it with a note documenting that you reviewed the dose. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it right away."
